    {
      "source": "Sets the <code>ClientSession</code> into the Reactor <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/util/context/Context.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.util.context\"><code>Context</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将 `<code>ClientSession`</code> 设置到 Reactor <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/util/context/Context.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.util.context\"><code>Context</code></a> 中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Gets the <code>Mono&lt;ClientSession&gt;</code> from Reactor <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/util/context/Context.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.util.context\"><code>Context</code></a>. The resulting <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a>\nemits the <code>ClientSession</code> if a session is associated with the current <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/util/context/Context.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.util.context\"><code>subscriber context</code></a>. If the context does not contain a session, the resulting <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> terminates empty (i.e.\nwithout emitting a value).",
      "translation": "获取 Reactor <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/util/context/Context.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.util.context\"><code>Context</code></a> 中的 <code>Mono&lt;ClientSession&gt;</code>。生成的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a>\n会在当前 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/util/context/Context.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.util.context\"><code>subscriber context</code></a> 关联有会话时发出 <code>ClientSession</code>。如果上下文中不包含会话，则生成的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> 将空终止（即不发出任何值）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"ReactiveMongoContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>ReactiveMongoContext</code></a> utilizes and enriches the Reactor <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/util/context/Context.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.util.context\"><code>Context</code></a> with information potentially required\nfor e.g. <code>ClientSession</code> handling and transactions.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"ReactiveMongoContext.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.mongodb.core\"><code>ReactiveMongoContext</code></a> 利用并增强了 Reactor 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/util/context/Context.html\" title=\"类或接口 reactor.util.context\"><code>Context</code></a>，添加了可能需要的信息，例如用于处理 <code>ClientSession</code> 和事务。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Gets the <code>Mono&lt;ClientSession&gt;</code> from Reactor <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/util/context/Context.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.util.context\"><code>Context</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取 Reactor <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/util/context/Context.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.util.context\"><code>Context</code></a> 中的<code>Mono&lt;ClientSession&gt;</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> emitting the client session if present; otherwise the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> terminates empty.",
      "translation": "发出客户端会话（如果存在）的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a>；否则，<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> 以空状态终止。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "a new <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/util/context/Context.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.util.context\"><code>Context</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个新的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/util/context/Context.html\" title=\"类或接口在 reactor.util.context\"><code>Context</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>context</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>context</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
